  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "XF01114",
    "sub_id": "08342",
    "scr_dup": "007",
    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1. Be on time. You will be counted as absent if you are late for class and miss roll call. Also, the instructor will mark your attendance status as absent for both classes. Therefore, remember to see the instructor during the class break to change your attendance status for the second period of class. 請準時上課。點名時一次點兩節課，點名後才進教室者，該節將以曠課論，並請同學於課間自行找教師補點名，以銷掉第二節課之曠課記錄。\n\n2. Participate in the class discussion and class activities. 請參與課堂討論及課堂活動。\n\n3. Please purchase original textbook, following intellectual property law. The texts and exercises will be completed in class. Please bring textbooks to class. 請購買正版課本，請勿使用複製版本。上課請攜帶課本，以利上課活動使用。\n\n4.  Please be punctual in submitting and uploading your assignments. Late or replacement assignments will not be accepted (leave-takers are advised to pay attention to the due date of their assignments). 繳交、上傳作業請務必準時， 一律不接受遲交或補交作業 (請假者請自行注意作業繳交日期)。\n\n5. Students must submit a leave application to the school in advance, stating the reason for the leave and the expected duration. 學生必須提前向學校提交請假申請，說明請假的原因和預計時間。\n\n6. Follow the school rules to apply for a make-up exam within three days of the exam date. Relevant documents are required for the application. No-shows or those with late application will receive ZERO. The date of a make-up exam will be arranged by the instructor. 若須要補考的同學，請遵照學校的補考規定，在考試後的3天內提出申請。若考試當天沒有出現或者是沒有申請補考的同學，考試成績一律0分。\n\n7. Following the FCU Exam Regulations, cheaters will receive ZERO for their exams and such cases will be reviewed by the Student Reward and Disciplinary Committee. 考試請遵照考場規定，若作弊者以0分計算。\n\n8. No make-up exams will be accepted for midterm and final exams/reports unless there are special reasons and the following three items are met:\n•  Notify the instructor in advance at least 2 weeks prior to the examination date.\n•  Presentation of relevant official documents (hospitalisation certificate, surgical certificate, competition certificate, etc.)\n• With the prior consent of the teaching staff\n* If there is a major incident on the examination day, you must contact the teaching staff via iLearn within 3 days from the examination date to provide official documents and apply for a supplementary examination.\n期中考和期末考/報告一率不接受補考，除非為特殊原因並符合以下三項：\n• 於考試日期前至少2個禮拜事先告知授課教師\n• 提出相關正式證明文件 (住院證明、手術證明、參賽證明等)\n• 經授課教師事先同意\n* 如考試當天有重大事故，必須於考試日期起三天內以iLearn聯繫授課教師，提供正式證明文件，申請補考",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<ol>\n\t<li>Students must exhibit honesty and ethical behavior in their academic activities, avoiding plagiarism and falsification of data.學生在學術活動中必須展現誠實和道德行為，避免抄襲和篡改資料。</li>\n\t<li>Plagiarism: Proper citation of sources is required. Copying or using others&#39; work without appropriate attribution is considered plagiarism.抄襲：必須適當引用來源。未經適當標示使用他人作品屬於抄襲行為。</li>\n\t<li>Cheating: Following exam rules is mandatory. Unauthorized materials or collusion with others during exams is considered cheating.考試作弊：必須遵守考試規則，禁止使用未經授權的材料或與他人串通作弊。</li>\n</ol>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
